{"synopsis":"Pada awal dao bela diri binatang buas yang tidak normal menyerbu dunia Bela diri umat manusia harus mundur dalam kekalahan berkalikali Lu Sheng bertransmigrasi ke masa itu tetapi dalam mimpinya dia memasuki dunia 10000 tahun kemudian Metode pemurnian tubuh dasar dari 10 ribu tahun ke depan beberapa ribu kali lebih efektif daripada yang sekarang Lalu ada metode pernapasan formula pil pemurnian tubuh dan darurat militer suci dari 10 ribu tahun kemudian Meskipun seni bela diri berkembang selama 10 ribu tahun umat manusia dimusnahkan Peradaban seni bela diri mereka mencapai puncaknya namun tidak ada yang tersisa untuk mewarisinya Kecuali Lu Sheng dia adalah percikan harapan terakhir","alternative_title":"Apex Future Martial Arts, Gāo Wǔ: Dēnglù Wèilái Yī Wàn Nián, Logging 10,000 Years into the Future, Martial Art: Future's Ten Thousand Years, 高武：登陆未来一万年","author":"常盘勇者","artist":"], 常盘勇者 [Add","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"742db9c0-7099-4941-a7d8-02a9f471ebb2","number":"341","chapter":"341","title":"Chapter 341","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2f1f5ab3-cdb5-48fc-bcb9-fc9a498f6ae7","number":"340","chapter":"340","title":"Chapter 340","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1b6c44de-82fe-4e38-a06f-7c2b7e8e9beb","number":"339","chapter":"339","title":"Chapter 339","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"96f30d16-f92a-40c0-b5e2-c71917121096","number":"338","chapter":"338","title":"Chapter 338","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"8ce8441b-9fcc-42ef-b194-4ba96e1f098e","number":"337","chapter":"337","title":"Chapter 337","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"5068c5bc-ac65-4755-9922-63d77414a5f0","number":"336","chapter":"336","title":"Chapter 336","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"81d4fd55-d4f9-4c88-8606-eb389adaf46a","number":"335","chapter":"335","title":"C